  <h1>About Bharat Business Index</h1>
  <p>India's independent, data-driven business ranking platform.</p>
</div>

<div class="section" style="max-width:760px">
  
  <div class="article-content" style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--text-primary)">
    <p>Finding a reliable local business shouldn't be complicated, nor should it depend on who has the largest advertising budget. <strong>Bharat Business Index (BBI)</strong> was created to solve a fundamental problem in local search: the lack of objective, independent business rankings.</p>
    
    <p>We are India's premier data-driven ranking platform, evaluating businesses across multiple cities and categories to help consumers make informed decisions based on merit, not marketing.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size:24px;margin-top:40px;margin-bottom:20px;color:var(--navy)">Our Mission</h2>
    <p>Our mission is simple: <strong>To provide the most accurate, transparent, and objective business rankings in India.</strong></p>
    <p>We believe that outstanding service should be rewarded with visibility. By aggregating real customer feedback, analyzing digital presence, and applying a rigorous editorial standard, we shine a light on businesses that genuinely deliver value to their communities.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size:24px;margin-top:40px;margin-bottom:20px;color:var(--navy)">Editorial Independence</h2>
    <div style="background:var(--bg);padding:24px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--border-light);margin-bottom:24px">
      <p style="margin:0;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy)">BBI rankings cannot be purchased.</p>
    </div>
    <p>Unlike traditional directories where businesses can pay for top placement, BBI operates with strict editorial independence. Our scoring algorithm evaluates every business using the exact same criteria. While we do offer clearly labeled "Sponsored" placements to support our platform, these advertisements have absolutely zero impact on a business's organic BBI ranking score.</p>
    
    <p>We recalculate all rankings on the first of every month to ensure our index reflects the current reality of the market.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size:24px;margin-top:40px;margin-bottom:20px;color:var(--navy)">How We Work</h2>
    <p>Our proprietary scoring engine evaluates businesses out of 100 points, broken down into six transparent categories:</p>
    <ul style="margin-bottom:24px;padding-left:20px">
      <li><strong>Customer Reviews (35%):</strong> Quality and consistency of customer feedback</li>
      <li><strong>Review Volume (25%):</strong> Quantity of feedback to ensure statistical significance</li>
      <li><strong>Online Presence (15%):</strong> Digital footprint and accessibility</li>
      <li><strong>Verification Status (10%):</strong> Confirmation of legitimate business operations</li>
      <li><strong>Profile Completeness (10%):</strong> Availability of crucial consumer information</li>
      <li><strong>Editorial Assessment (15%):</strong> Independent quality review by our team</li>
    </ul>
    <p>For a detailed breakdown of how scores are calculated, please read our <a href="/methodology" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;text-decoration:underline">Methodology</a>.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size:24px;margin-top:40px;margin-bottom:20px;color:var(--navy)">Contact Us</h2>
    <p>We're always looking to improve our platform. Whether you're a consumer with feedback, a business owner with questions, or media seeking information, we'd love to hear from you.</p>
